; Regeneration
;   From Hardware/EdgeBoard/KiCad, re-run the command above with KiCad 9's
;   kicad-cli (the schematic is a KiCad 9 file), then put this header back.
;   KiCad 10.0's export appends each pin's number to its pin function
;   ("Pin_1" becomes "Pin_1_1", "P37" "P37_3"), which renames every pin a
;   survey lists. The export is not byte-stable: the (design (source …)) path
;   and the (date …) change on every run. This header is `;` line comments,
;   which embsim's netlist parser skips wherever whitespace is legal.
